WEBVTT

00:00:00.542 --> 00:00:02.460
Previously on Love Live!

00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:06.506
Advancing through the final preliminaries,
we earned a spot at Love Live.

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:10.635
But waiting for us was a
discussion of our future...

00:00:10.635 --> 00:00:12.887
Our graduation is inevitable.

00:00:12.887 --> 00:00:14.055
Let's discuss what we really want.

00:00:14.055 --> 00:00:17.058
Do you think I have what it takes to join J's?

00:00:17.434 --> 00:00:19.811
Honoka and the others
came up with an answer.

00:00:19.811 --> 00:00:25.150
Once the competition is over, we will end u's!

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.736
The culmination of our efforts is approaching!

00:00:27.736 --> 00:00:30.030
The last concert of U's is happening now!

00:00:30.322 --> 00:00:32.282
Entry No. 11!

00:00:32.616 --> 00:00:36.036
Otonokizaka High's school idol group, p's!

00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:53.261
Nico-chan.

00:00:53.928 --> 00:00:56.139
You're drawing for us.

00:00:56.139 --> 00:00:58.558
What!? M-Me?

00:00:58.558 --> 00:01:00.727
You're the club president until you graduate.

00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:03.229
Yeah! You gotta finish strong!

00:01:07.192 --> 00:01:08.568
Fine!

00:01:12.656 --> 00:01:14.157
We're finally here.

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:15.909
Yeah.

00:01:17.452 --> 00:01:18.578
Love Live...

00:01:19.329 --> 00:01:21.665
Group representative, please come forward.

00:01:23.041 --> 00:01:29.255
Saa yume wo kanaeru no wa minna no yuuki Come
on... Our courage makes our dreams come true

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:36.846
makenai (kokoro de) ashita e kaketeyukou Let's
run toward tomorrow with unbeaten (hearts)

00:01:43.895 --> 00:01:49.234
Tsuyoi tsuyoi negaigoto ga
A strong, strong wish

00:01:49.234 --> 00:01:54.781
bokutachi wo michibiite kureta
Led us along

00:01:54.781 --> 00:01:59.869
tsugi wa zettai yuzurenaiyo
We can't give up the next one

00:01:59.869 --> 00:02:04.999
nokosareta jikan wo nigirishimete We'll hold
on tightly to the time we have remaining

00:02:04.999 --> 00:02:10.505
tada no omoide sore dake ja iyadayo
We don't want only a memory

00:02:10.505 --> 00:02:16.344
<i>seiippai chikara no kagiri hashirunda
We'll run as hard as we can</i>

00:02:16.344 --> 00:02:19.222
(CHANCE FOR ME CHANCE FOR YOU)
(Chance for me! Chance for you!)

00:02:19.222 --> 00:02:24.811
Saa yume wo dakishimetara ue wo muite
Come on... Embrace your dreams and look up

00:02:24.811 --> 00:02:29.607
kimi no sekai ga ohkiku kawaruyo
Your world will change dramatically

00:02:29.607 --> 00:02:35.739
saa yume wo kanaeru no wa minna no yuuki Come
on... Our courage makes our dreams come true

00:02:35.739 --> 00:02:40.785
makenai (kokoro de) ashita e kaketeyukou Let's
run toward tomorrow with unbeaten (hearts)

00:02:40.785 --> 00:02:46.124
Ima koko de deaeta kiseki
The miracle that we met here and now

00:02:46.124 --> 00:02:52.839
wasurenaide bokutachi no kisetsu
Don't forget our season

00:02:56.593 --> 00:02:58.553
Nico-chan, you're amazing!

00:02:58.553 --> 00:03:02.599
O-Of course I am. Who do you think I am?

00:03:03.308 --> 00:03:05.935
I'm the best idol in the Milky Way Galaxy!

00:03:06.352 --> 00:03:08.646
#12 - Last Concert
I'm Nico-Ni-Nico-chan.

00:03:10.231 --> 00:03:11.357
I was so nervous...

00:03:11.357 --> 00:03:15.403
But we're the very last group to perform.
That, in itself, comes with pressure.

00:03:15.403 --> 00:03:17.572
We need to overcome that.

00:03:17.572 --> 00:03:20.241
But I think this was for the best.

00:03:20.742 --> 00:03:25.079
We made it to Love Live, and
we get to sing at the end.

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:27.040
You're right.

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:30.418
I knew p's had the power all along.

00:03:30.418 --> 00:03:33.129
Hey, wait. I'm the one who drew it!

00:03:33.546 --> 00:03:35.256
Yeah, yeah. You sure did.

00:03:35.256 --> 00:03:36.716
Good girl!

00:03:36.716 --> 00:03:37.675
That's it!?

00:03:37.675 --> 00:03:39.803
Come on. Let's start practice.

00:03:39.803 --> 00:03:40.887
Okay!

00:03:40.887 --> 00:03:42.388
Hey, wait!

00:03:44.808 --> 00:03:46.476
Sheesh...

00:03:46.935 --> 00:03:48.603
It's okay.

00:03:50.271 --> 00:03:51.689
Hanayo...

00:03:51.689 --> 00:03:55.693
No matter what everyone says,
they're all really grateful.

00:03:55.693 --> 00:03:57.237
I Know.

00:03:57.237 --> 00:03:57.737
Huh?

00:03:58.822 --> 00:04:02.325
We'll be our usual selves
until the very end, right?

00:04:04.327 --> 00:04:05.078
Yeah!

00:04:05.829 --> 00:04:07.956
Come on. Let's practice!

00:04:07.956 --> 00:04:08.873
Okay!

00:04:09.082 --> 00:04:10.583
Okay! Here we go!

00:04:10.583 --> 00:04:14.796
One, two, three, four! One, two, three, four!
One, two, three, four!

00:04:14.796 --> 00:04:16.464
Ta-da!

00:04:19.592 --> 00:04:21.970
It's quite warm.

00:04:21.970 --> 00:04:22.887
Thanks.

00:04:23.596 --> 00:04:24.097
Yeah.

00:04:24.639 --> 00:04:27.058
It makes me wanna take a nap.

00:04:27.058 --> 00:04:29.811
It's finally starting to feel like spring.

00:04:29.811 --> 00:04:32.814
The cherry blossoms are supposed
to bloom early this year, too.

00:04:32.814 --> 00:04:34.399
I see.

00:04:34.399 --> 00:04:36.359
It feels so nice.

00:04:45.326 --> 00:04:46.661
Honoka-chan.

00:04:46.661 --> 00:04:47.287
Huh?

00:04:47.287 --> 00:04:49.706
Don't be sad.

00:04:49.706 --> 00:04:51.499
We have to focus on Love Live for now.

00:04:51.875 --> 00:04:52.959
That's right.

00:04:56.087 --> 00:04:57.463
I Know.

00:04:58.673 --> 00:04:59.966
I just...

00:04:59.966 --> 00:05:00.925
Just what?

00:05:02.844 --> 00:05:04.679
Squeeze!

00:05:04.888 --> 00:05:06.180
What's going on?

00:05:06.180 --> 00:05:08.308
I suddenly wanted to hug you!

00:05:08.308 --> 00:05:09.726
Me, too!

00:05:09.726 --> 00:05:11.144
Squeeze!

00:05:11.144 --> 00:05:12.478
I can't breathe!

00:05:12.478 --> 00:05:14.063
Kotori, Honokal!

00:05:14.063 --> 00:05:16.232
Squeeze!

00:05:16.691 --> 00:05:19.110
Squeeze!

00:05:19.110 --> 00:05:20.403
Squeeze, squeeze, squeeze!

00:05:20.403 --> 00:05:22.572
Squeeze!

00:05:24.991 --> 00:05:26.618
Aww...

00:05:26.618 --> 00:05:28.912
Practice is over already?

00:05:28.912 --> 00:05:32.040
We can't be tired for our performance.

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:33.958
You're right.

00:05:38.129 --> 00:05:39.297
See you tomorrow.

00:05:40.006 --> 00:05:42.175
Make sure you don't get the time wrong.

00:05:42.175 --> 00:05:45.011
Let's contact each other in the morning.

00:05:45.011 --> 00:05:45.678
Okay.

00:05:46.220 --> 00:05:48.765
I'll call Honoka.

00:05:48.765 --> 00:05:51.184
I won't be late!

00:06:00.318 --> 00:06:06.741
Was this our last time practicing together?

00:06:15.458 --> 00:06:17.210
You're right.

00:06:17.210 --> 00:06:21.297
Eli didn't say anything,
even though she knew.

00:06:21.297 --> 00:06:23.883
Oh, right. Sorry.

00:06:23.883 --> 00:06:25.593
No, it's okay.

00:06:25.593 --> 00:06:28.554
I was actually thinking that, too.

00:06:35.895 --> 00:06:36.771
Don't.

00:06:37.397 --> 00:06:39.565
Focus on Love Live!

00:06:39.565 --> 00:06:41.234
We know.

00:06:42.026 --> 00:06:43.444
Then let's go.

00:06:48.199 --> 00:06:50.618
How long are you going
to keep standing there?

00:06:59.711 --> 00:07:02.338
Now we've taken care of everything.

00:07:02.338 --> 00:07:03.297
Yeah.

00:07:03.297 --> 00:07:07.218
Was it okay for us to ask for
so many things at once?

00:07:07.218 --> 00:07:08.678
It's fine.

00:07:08.678 --> 00:07:11.389
After all, we're all asking
for the same thing, right?

00:07:11.806 --> 00:07:12.640
What?

00:07:12.640 --> 00:07:18.146
We may have used different words, but I
feel like we all wished for the same thing.

00:07:18.146 --> 00:07:19.439
You're right.

00:07:19.439 --> 00:07:21.274
Let's do it one more time.

00:07:21.274 --> 00:07:23.568
Please grant our wish!

00:07:24.777 --> 00:07:26.988
Let's leave this time.

00:07:27.363 --> 00:07:29.157
Okay. See you tomorrow.

00:07:29.157 --> 00:07:29.699
Yeah.

00:07:31.909 --> 00:07:33.703
There's no end to this.

00:07:34.203 --> 00:07:36.247
She's right. Let's go home.

00:07:36.998 --> 00:07:38.207
Shall we go?

00:07:38.207 --> 00:07:38.791
Yeah.

00:07:39.375 --> 00:07:40.376
See you later.

00:07:40.376 --> 00:07:40.960
Bye-bye.

00:07:46.049 --> 00:07:48.092
Come on. Let's go home, too.

00:07:48.092 --> 00:07:50.720
Everyone will be there tomorrow.

00:07:50.720 --> 00:07:51.929
Yeah.

00:08:04.233 --> 00:08:05.985
Why are you still here?

00:08:05.985 --> 00:08:08.029
I could ask you the same thing.

00:08:08.029 --> 00:08:10.031
Huh? Girls...

00:08:12.033 --> 00:08:14.285
Honoka-chan, what's wrong?

00:08:14.285 --> 00:08:15.995
Huh? Oh, um...

00:08:17.205 --> 00:08:21.042
I thought everyone might still be around.

00:08:21.042 --> 00:08:22.335
Right!?

00:08:22.335 --> 00:08:26.130
What are we going to do?
At this rate, we'll never go home.

00:08:26.130 --> 00:08:27.715
You're right.

00:08:27.715 --> 00:08:29.509
Should we stay here until morning?

00:08:29.509 --> 00:08:30.593
Yeah, right.

00:08:32.220 --> 00:08:34.806
Then, why don't we do this?

00:08:35.348 --> 00:08:37.100
Done!

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:39.102
It fits perfectly.

00:08:39.102 --> 00:08:42.730
Staying overnight at school is so exciting!

00:08:42.730 --> 00:08:43.815
My heart is pounding!

00:08:43.815 --> 00:08:46.567
Is it really okay for us to do this?

00:08:46.567 --> 00:08:49.403
Yeah. When I asked my mom...

00:08:50.404 --> 00:08:54.367
You have to turn in a request for a
training camp two weeks in advance.

00:08:55.618 --> 00:08:56.452
But...

00:08:57.036 --> 00:09:00.456
...perhaps I misplaced it.

00:09:02.458 --> 00:09:03.376
Yeah!

00:09:05.545 --> 00:09:07.046
Thanks for waiting!

00:09:07.046 --> 00:09:09.757
Don't you think the stove in the
home ec. room is a little weak?

00:09:10.842 --> 00:09:11.801
That smells good!

00:09:11.801 --> 00:09:13.970
Hanayo, where's the rice?

00:09:16.305 --> 00:09:17.431
It's ready!

00:09:17.849 --> 00:09:18.724
Looks good!

00:09:18.724 --> 00:09:20.768
And I brought ramen!

00:09:20.768 --> 00:09:22.812
When did you get that?

00:09:23.563 --> 00:09:25.439
Let's have dinner.

00:09:27.233 --> 00:09:29.610
This feels like our club trip.

00:09:29.610 --> 00:09:31.654
But this is more fun.

00:09:32.071 --> 00:09:34.490
After all, we're at school. School!

00:09:34.490 --> 00:09:35.950
This is the best!

00:09:35.950 --> 00:09:38.703
You're such children.

00:09:41.164 --> 00:09:43.374
Hey, hey! It's nighttime right now, right?

00:09:43.958 --> 00:09:45.585
Yeah.

00:09:47.628 --> 00:09:48.504
Honoka-chan?

00:09:48.504 --> 00:09:51.048
What are you doing? It's cold!

00:09:52.341 --> 00:09:55.511
Isn't school so exciting at night?

00:09:55.511 --> 00:09:58.181
It feels different than usual.

00:09:58.181 --> 00:10:00.600
R-Really?

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:02.894
Let's tell ghost stories later!

00:10:02.894 --> 00:10:03.436
What!?

00:10:03.436 --> 00:10:05.146
Good idea!

00:10:05.146 --> 00:10:07.815
Eli-chi loves those.

00:10:07.815 --> 00:10:08.858
Nozomi!

00:10:08.858 --> 00:10:10.109
You do?

00:10:10.109 --> 00:10:12.486
What? No, I...

00:10:14.614 --> 00:10:17.867
O-Ouch... Eli-chan, that hurts.

00:10:17.867 --> 00:10:20.036
Don't let go! Don't let go! Please!

00:10:20.036 --> 00:10:20.369
What?

00:10:21.454 --> 00:10:23.206
Eli, are you...

00:10:23.206 --> 00:10:25.166
...Afraid of the dark?

00:10:26.125 --> 00:10:27.793
This is quite the new discovery, isn't it?

00:10:27.793 --> 00:10:30.379
Nozomi! Maki!

00:10:30.379 --> 00:10:31.088
Okay, okay.

00:10:32.340 --> 00:10:32.965
Wait!

00:10:36.552 --> 00:10:38.471
The stars are beautiful...

00:10:38.471 --> 00:10:42.433
Oh, right. There aren't many
lights around the school.

00:10:45.728 --> 00:10:49.190
Hey, wanna go up to the roof?

00:10:55.279 --> 00:10:57.365
Hanayo-chan, you're almost there!

00:10:57.365 --> 00:10:58.574
You can do it!

00:10:58.574 --> 00:10:59.450
Okay...

00:11:13.297 --> 00:11:14.799
This is amazing.

00:11:14.799 --> 00:11:16.717
It's like a sea of light.

00:11:17.260 --> 00:11:21.722
Every one of these lights
belongs to someone.

00:11:21.722 --> 00:11:27.353
Everyone lives inside those lights,
and experiences happiness and sorrow.

00:11:27.353 --> 00:11:32.858
There are lots of people in those lights
who we've never spoken to, met,

00:11:33.401 --> 00:11:37.822
or had the chance to interact with.

00:11:38.447 --> 00:11:42.868
But we connected with them as school idols.

00:11:44.036 --> 00:11:44.996
Yeah.

00:11:45.913 --> 00:11:49.000
They happened to hear our song.

00:11:50.126 --> 00:11:51.752
It may have made them think.

00:11:52.586 --> 00:11:54.588
Made them a little happy.

00:11:56.048 --> 00:11:58.134
Given them a little energy.

00:11:59.010 --> 00:12:02.722
Or made them smile a little.

00:12:04.974 --> 00:12:06.183
It's wonderful.

00:12:06.851 --> 00:12:09.437
That's why idols are the best.

00:12:09.437 --> 00:12:10.187
Yeah.

00:12:21.490 --> 00:12:28.080
I'm glad I became a school idol!

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:30.041
Where did that come from!?

00:12:30.499 --> 00:12:32.710
That's just how I feel.

00:12:33.044 --> 00:12:36.672
I want these feelings to reach everyone.

00:12:37.381 --> 00:12:44.055
Hey, everyone! Listen to us
sing our hearts out tomorrow!

00:12:51.896 --> 00:12:56.067
Hey, everyone! Listen to us!

00:13:01.238 --> 00:13:02.656
Love Live!

00:13:16.337 --> 00:13:18.214
What great weather!

00:13:19.256 --> 00:13:20.466
It's so bright...

00:13:20.466 --> 00:13:22.134
Close the curtains...

00:13:23.677 --> 00:13:25.846
Wake up!

00:13:25.846 --> 00:13:26.931
- Honoka?
- What?

00:13:27.264 --> 00:13:28.349
It's morning!

00:13:28.349 --> 00:13:29.975
It's Love Live!

00:13:33.854 --> 00:13:35.731
This is the event space...

00:13:35.731 --> 00:13:36.899
It's huge!

00:13:36.899 --> 00:13:40.027
The scale of this event is totally different.

00:13:40.027 --> 00:13:42.488
I can't believe we get to sing here...

00:13:42.863 --> 00:13:46.951
Love Live receives the same level
of attention as actual top idols.

00:13:46.951 --> 00:13:47.660
Oh, right.

00:13:47.660 --> 00:13:51.038
Everyone will be watching us...

00:14:02.091 --> 00:14:04.009
The lights are amazing.

00:14:04.760 --> 00:14:06.846
They're so bright.

00:14:06.846 --> 00:14:11.350
Considering the number of groups performing,
it's no wonder the facilities are so gorgeous.

00:14:11.350 --> 00:14:13.352
Huh? Girls?

00:14:13.352 --> 00:14:16.063
Kayo-chin, over here!

00:14:16.063 --> 00:14:18.149
Don't get lost!

00:14:18.149 --> 00:14:19.859
We're going to sing here.

00:14:20.359 --> 00:14:23.112
We get to sing here!

00:14:23.112 --> 00:14:24.113
You're right.

00:14:37.626 --> 00:14:41.338
Wow! Look at how big that sign is!

00:14:41.881 --> 00:14:44.258
Yukiho, Yukiho, let's take a picture!

00:14:44.258 --> 00:14:45.509
Yeah, yeah.

00:14:45.509 --> 00:14:47.136
Let's aim to perform here someday.

00:14:48.095 --> 00:14:49.680
We'll be late.

00:14:50.139 --> 00:14:53.851
Are they going to be okay
in such a huge space?

00:14:53.851 --> 00:14:56.479
They're supposed to be a favorite.

00:14:56.479 --> 00:14:57.813
They might be nervous.

00:14:57.813 --> 00:14:59.356
It's okay.

00:14:59.356 --> 00:15:02.693
This is nothing compared to
an empty auditorium, right?

00:15:03.068 --> 00:15:04.195
You're right.

00:15:04.695 --> 00:15:06.238
Are we okay on time?

00:15:06.238 --> 00:15:09.283
Each school's cheering section
enters at a set time, right?

00:15:09.825 --> 00:15:11.160
Oh, you're right.

00:15:12.328 --> 00:15:13.329
Excuse me...

00:15:14.079 --> 00:15:16.165
Would you like one of these?

00:15:17.291 --> 00:15:19.627
Don't worry about us!

00:15:26.467 --> 00:15:28.928
Everyone looks so cute!

00:15:28.928 --> 00:15:29.887
Way to go, Kotori.

00:15:30.346 --> 00:15:34.391
Yeah. I did my best to make
them our cutest outfits ever.

00:15:34.767 --> 00:15:36.435
I think they're wonderful.

00:15:36.435 --> 00:15:37.978
They're great.

00:15:37.978 --> 00:15:40.022
Is everyone ready?

00:15:40.022 --> 00:15:41.148
Yes!

00:15:45.694 --> 00:15:49.073
The audience must be huge...

00:15:49.073 --> 00:15:50.699
This is exciting.

00:15:51.325 --> 00:15:56.747
I've made a habit of enjoying
singing in front of tons of people.

00:15:59.625 --> 00:16:02.711
Do I look okay? Do I look cute?

00:16:02.711 --> 00:16:05.714
You'll be fine. You look really cute!

00:16:06.882 --> 00:16:08.050
How about me?

00:16:08.050 --> 00:16:09.802
You look cute, too.

00:16:10.177 --> 00:16:11.345
I won't hold back today.

00:16:11.345 --> 00:16:14.265
I'll be moving to the front,
SO prepare yourselves.

00:16:14.265 --> 00:16:15.724
You are?

00:16:15.724 --> 00:16:19.395
Then I'll stand out as much
as I can, like I'm the center.

00:16:19.853 --> 00:16:21.689
It's my last performance as a school idol.

00:16:21.689 --> 00:16:23.357
Sounds fun.

00:16:23.816 --> 00:16:24.942
They're really into this.

00:16:24.942 --> 00:16:27.236
Maki-chan, we can't let them beat us.

00:16:27.236 --> 00:16:28.946
I know that.

00:16:28.946 --> 00:16:32.866
You may be third years, but if you're
not careful, I'll leave you behind,

00:16:32.866 --> 00:16:35.578
Miss Best Idol in the Universe.

00:16:36.745 --> 00:16:39.081
That's quite an interesting statement.

00:16:39.081 --> 00:16:43.669
You'd better prepare yourself for
making me unleash my best effort!

00:16:44.003 --> 00:16:46.338
It's almost time.

00:16:46.338 --> 00:16:46.964
Yeah.

00:16:47.464 --> 00:16:49.925
Girls, let's give it everything we have.

00:16:51.176 --> 00:16:57.182
Let's put all our feelings, wishes,
and gratitude into our song!

00:17:06.442 --> 00:17:07.943
What's wrong?

00:17:07.943 --> 00:17:10.863
I don't know what to say.

00:17:11.363 --> 00:17:12.656
What do you mean by that?

00:17:13.365 --> 00:17:15.492
Because there really isn't anything left to say.

00:17:16.118 --> 00:17:18.162
I've already said everything.

00:17:18.579 --> 00:17:20.331
Our feelings are already united.

00:17:21.624 --> 00:17:26.545
Everyone is thinking and
feeling the same thing.

00:17:27.588 --> 00:17:28.631
Isn't that right?

00:17:29.673 --> 00:17:30.924
Yeah.

00:17:34.970 --> 00:17:38.599
Let's give our last concert
as M's everything we have!

00:17:39.433 --> 00:17:40.225
One!

00:17:40.225 --> 00:17:40.768
Two!

00:17:40.768 --> 00:17:41.393
Three!

00:17:41.393 --> 00:17:42.186
Four!

00:17:42.186 --> 00:17:42.936
Five!

00:17:42.936 --> 00:17:43.562
Six!

00:17:43.562 --> 00:17:44.104
Seven!

00:17:44.104 --> 00:17:44.813
Eight!

00:17:44.813 --> 00:17:45.522
Nine!

00:17:45.939 --> 00:17:50.903
M's music start!

00:18:21.183 --> 00:18:25.688
Donna ashita ga matterundarou nantene What kind
of tomorrow is waiting for us? Just kidding

00:18:25.688 --> 00:18:30.401
(boku wa) bokutachi wa sukoshizutsu tesaqguri shiteta
(1 was) We were fumbling for something little by little

00:18:30.943 --> 00:18:36.407
hagemashiatte butsukariatta toki de sae Even
when we encouraged each other or clashed

00:18:36.407 --> 00:18:40.994
(wakatteta) onnaji yume wo miteruto
(We knew) We were seeing the same dream

00:18:40.994 --> 00:18:44.289
mezasunowa ano taiyou
We are aiming for that sun

00:18:44.289 --> 00:18:49.169
ohkina kagayaki wo tsukamaeru
We will catch that huge brightness

00:18:49.169 --> 00:18:54.174
itsuka no negai e to chikazuite
Approaching the wish for our future

00:18:54.174 --> 00:18:58.971
hikari no naka de utaunda SENSATION We
will sing within the brightness Sensation!

00:18:58.971 --> 00:19:04.268
Kiseki sore wa imasa koko nanda
A miracle is happening now and here

00:19:04.268 --> 00:19:09.106
minna no omoi ga michibiita bashonanda
Everyone's desires brought us here

00:19:09.106 --> 00:19:14.069
dakara hontou ni ima wo tanoshinde
That's why we will truly enjoy the present

00:19:14.069 --> 00:19:19.324
minna de kanaeru monogatari yume no STORY A
story we achieve together, a story of dreams

00:19:19.324 --> 00:19:21.785
mabushiina iina oideyo
It's bright! Great! Come on!

00:19:21.785 --> 00:19:24.455
Ureshiina iina mottone
I'm so happy! Great! More!

00:19:24.455 --> 00:19:28.751
Hitotsu ni nare kokoro KIRA KIRA
May our hearts become one... KiRa-KiRa!!

00:19:54.193 --> 00:19:55.944
Thank you very much!

00:19:56.445 --> 00:19:58.155
Tojo Nozomi.

00:19:58.155 --> 00:19:59.823
Nishikino Maki.

00:19:59.823 --> 00:20:01.158
Sonoda Umi.

00:20:01.658 --> 00:20:03.202
Hoshizora Rin.

00:20:03.202 --> 00:20:04.828
Yazawa Nico.

00:20:04.828 --> 00:20:06.330
Koizumi Hanayo.

00:20:06.330 --> 00:20:07.873
Ayase Eli.

00:20:08.248 --> 00:20:09.625
Minami Kotori.

00:20:10.000 --> 00:20:11.835
Kosaka Honoka.

00:20:12.503 --> 00:20:16.340
We're Otonokizaka High's
school idol group, y's!

00:20:16.340 --> 00:20:19.718
Thank you very much!

00:20:49.873 --> 00:21:32.583
Encore! Encore! Encore!

00:21:32.583 --> 00:21:35.586
It's possible no one will give us a chance.

00:21:35.586 --> 00:21:38.630
Maybe we'll never get any support at all.

00:21:38.630 --> 00:21:44.344
But I still want to work hard and give
people what we're able to give them.

00:21:44.344 --> 00:21:48.348
I want to share my current feeling with them!

00:21:48.348 --> 00:22:05.490
Encore! Encore! Encore!

00:22:16.585 --> 00:22:21.715
<i>Massugu ha omoi ga minna wo musubu Our honest
feelings are what will tie us all together.</i>

00:22:21.715 --> 00:22:26.553
Honki demo bukiyou butsukariau kokoro Even with our
clumsy sincerity, our hearts will still collide.

00:22:26.553 --> 00:22:31.350
Sore demo mitaiyo ohkina yume wa And despite
it all, we want to dream a really grand dream.

00:22:31.350 --> 00:22:35.938
Koko ni aruyo hajimatta bakari That dream
is here, and it has only now just begun!

00:22:35.938 --> 00:22:37.022
(wakatteru)
(We understand)

00:22:37.022 --> 00:22:40.943
Tanoshii dakejanai tamesarerudarou That it's not
all fun and games— we'll face a lot of obstacles.

00:22:40.943 --> 00:22:41.985
(wakatteru)
(We understand)

00:22:41.985 --> 00:22:45.864
Datte sono kurushisa mo mirai That those
hardships will be paving our futures...

00:22:45.864 --> 00:22:46.907
ikundayo
So here we go!

00:22:46.907 --> 00:22:51.036
Atsumattara tsuyoi jibun ni nattekuyo If we all
join together, we'll be able to become stronger.

00:22:51.036 --> 00:22:55.666
(Kittone) kawari tsuzukete (WE'LL BE A STARY/) (We're sure
that) we will all grow and mature. (We'll become stars!)

00:22:55.666 --> 00:23:00.754
Sorezore ga sukina koto de ganbarerunara That's why we feel
that if we give the things that we love the most our all,

00:23:00.754 --> 00:23:05.384
atarashii (basho ga) gohru dane what awaits
then (our new place) will be our goal.

00:23:05.384 --> 00:23:10.514
Sorezore no sukina koto wo shinjiteireba That's why we
feel that if we believe in the things we love in our lives,

00:23:10.514 --> 00:23:15.435
tokimeki wo (daite) susumerudarou we can learn to
love (then embrace) our butterflies and advance!

00:23:15.435 --> 00:23:20.983
(kowagaru kuse wa sutechae) tobikiri no egao de So crumple up your
fears, throw them away, and then just put on your brightest smiles!

00:23:20.983 --> 00:23:28.532
(tonde tonde takaku) bokura wa ima no naka de (Higher and higher
we"ll fly) The lights that are shining within our hearts...

00:23:29.908 --> 00:23:33.286
kagayaki wo matteta
They're waiting to brighten the world.

00:23:35.664 --> 00:23:40.502
Next time on Love Live!
"May Everyone's Dream Come True!"
